---
title: Accordion | Anthony Toolkits
---

{% from "components/atoms/component-page.njk" import pageIntro, scriptUsage %}

{{ pageIntro({ label: '_accordion', title: 'Accordion', description: 'Stacked titles that open and close their content in place, for FAQs and long lists. One open at a time by default, keyboard friendly, and find in page opens the set holding the match.' }) }}

{% set faq = [
    { q: 'Can more than one set be open?', a: 'Yes, pass closeOthers: false. By default opening one closes the others, like the list you are reading.' },
    { q: 'What if I click again while it animates?', a: 'It turns around from where it is. There is no lock, so fast clicks never leave a set half open.' },
    { q: 'Does find in page work on closed sets?', a: 'Closed contents get hidden="until-found", so in Chrome and Edge searching with Ctrl/Cmd + F opens the set with the match. Other browsers keep them hidden as before.' },
    { q: 'Do I need a button for the title?', a: 'A button is best. Any other element still gets role="button", focus and Enter/Space, so older markup with a div keeps working.' }
] %}

{% set set = 'js-accordion-set border-b border-gray-200' %}
{% set title = 'js-accordion-set-title group flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-6 py-5 text-left text-lg font-semibold transition-colors hover:text-gray-600' %}
{% set chevron = '<svg class="size-5 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 group-aria-expanded:rotate-180" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6" /></svg>' %}

{% set markup %}{% raw %}
<div class="js-accordion">
    <div class="js-accordion-set">
        <button class="js-accordion-set-title group" type="button">
            Question
            <svg class="group-aria-expanded:rotate-180">...</svg>
        </button>
        <!-- hidden avoids a flash, padding goes inside -->
        <div class="js-accordion-set-content" hidden="until-found">
            <div class="pb-5">Answer</div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- chat bubbles: chat-set on the set, chat-question on the title, --chat-width for the sent bubble -->
<div class="js-accordion js-accordion-chat flex flex-col gap-3 [--chat-width:65%]">
    <div class="js-accordion-set chat-set">
        <button class="js-accordion-set-title chat-question rounded-3xl bg-white aria-expanded:rounded-bl-md aria-expanded:bg-violet-600 aria-expanded:text-white" type="button">Question</button>
        <div class="js-accordion-set-content" hidden="until-found">
            <div class="flex items-end justify-end gap-3 py-3">
                <!-- it pops out of this corner -->
                <div class="chat-bubble origin-bottom-right rounded-3xl rounded-br-md bg-white">
                    <p class="chat-text">Answer</p>
                </div>
                <span class="chat-avatar">AT</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
{% endraw %}{% endset %}

{# demo: an FAQ, one set at a time, the first open #}
<section class="px-4 py-16">
    <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-295 flex-col gap-6">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-4">
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight">FAQ</h2>
            <p class="font-mono text-sm text-gray-500">last event: <span class="js-accordion-event">-</span></p>
        </div>
        <div class="js-accordion max-w-3xl border-t border-gray-200">
            {% for item in faq %}
            <div class="{{ set }}">
                <button class="{{ title }}" type="button">{{ item.q }}{{ chevron | safe }}</button>
                <div class="js-accordion-set-content" hidden="until-found">
                    <p class="max-w-2xl pb-5 text-gray-600">{{ item.a }}</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            {% endfor %}
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

{% set chats = [
    { q: 'Hi! What do you build?', a: 'Websites and the small bits that make them feel alive, like this chat.' },
    { q: 'How long does a site take?', a: 'Most take 6 to 10 weeks, from the first call to launch day.' },
    { q: 'Can you work with our designer?', a: 'Of course. We can build from their files, or design it together.' },
    { q: 'Do you look after it after launch?', a: 'Yes, with a monthly plan for updates, fixes and new pages.' }
] %}

{# demo: chat bubbles, the same accordion with chat-accordion.css #}
<section class="bg-violet-50 px-4 py-16">
    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-295 gap-10 md:grid-cols-[2fr_3fr]">
        <div>
            <h2 class="mb-4 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight">Chat bubbles</h2>
            <p class="max-w-sm text-gray-600">The open question shrinks into a bubble on the left, and the answer pops out of the avatar on the right. Same accordion, the look is css.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="js-accordion js-accordion-chat flex flex-col gap-3 [--chat-width:85%] md:[--chat-width:65%]">
            {% for item in chats %}
            <div class="js-accordion-set chat-set">
                <button class="js-accordion-set-title chat-question group flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 rounded-3xl bg-white px-6 py-4 text-left font-medium hover:bg-violet-100 aria-expanded:cursor-default aria-expanded:rounded-bl-md aria-expanded:bg-violet-600 aria-expanded:text-white" type="button">
                    {{ item.q }}
                    <span class="text-xl leading-none text-violet-600 group-aria-expanded:hidden" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
                </button>
                <div class="js-accordion-set-content" hidden="until-found">
                    <div class="flex items-end justify-end gap-3 pt-3 pb-3">
                        <div class="chat-bubble max-w-[80%] origin-bottom-right rounded-3xl rounded-br-md bg-white px-6 py-4 shadow-sm">
                            <p class="chat-text">{{ item.a }}</p>
                        </div>
                        <span class="chat-avatar grid size-10 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-gray-950 text-xs font-semibold text-white" aria-hidden="true">AT</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            {% endfor %}
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

{# demo: many open, all closed, nested accordion #}
<section class="bg-gray-50 px-4 py-16">
    <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-295 flex-col gap-6">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight">Many open and nested</h2>
        <div class="js-accordion js-accordion-many max-w-3xl border-t border-gray-200">
            {% for i in range(1, 4) %}
            <div class="{{ set }}">
                <button class="{{ title }}" type="button">Section {{ i }}{{ chevron | safe }}</button>
                <div class="js-accordion-set-content" hidden="until-found">
                    <div class="pb-5">
                        <p class="max-w-2xl text-gray-600">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Libero est illo eius laudantium laborum earum culpa corporis vel deleniti.</p>
                        {% if i == 2 %}
                        <div class="js-accordion mt-4 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-white px-6">
                            {% for j in range(1, 4) %}
                            <div class="js-accordion-set border-b border-gray-200 last:border-b-0">
                                <button class="{{ title | replace('text-lg', 'text-base') }}" type="button">Nested {{ i }}.{{ j }}{{ chevron | safe }}</button>
                                <div class="js-accordion-set-content" hidden="until-found">
                                    <p class="pb-5 text-gray-600">Its own accordion: opening this one closes its siblings, not the sections outside.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            {% endfor %}
                        </div>
                        {% endif %}
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            {% endfor %}
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

{% set pageScript %}{% raw %}
// Requirements
    // JS
        // src/assets/js/utils/_emitter.js
        // src/assets/js/utils/_accordion.js
    // CSS, chat bubbles only
        // src/assets/css/components/chat-accordion.css

const _event = document.querySelector('.js-accordion-event'); // demo

document.querySelectorAll('.js-accordion').forEach((target) => {
    const _many = target.classList.contains('js-accordion-many');

    new _accordion({
        target,
        // defaults: closeOthers: true, openFirst: true, duration: 300
        closeOthers: !_many,
        // a little longer, so the bubbles have time to pop
        duration: target.matches('.js-accordion-chat') ? 450 : 300,
        openFirst: !_many && !target.closest('.js-accordion-set'),
        events: {
            // after the animation, instance.item is the set
            // open: (instance) => console.log('open', instance.item),
            // close: (instance) => console.log('close', instance.item),
            open: (instance) => (_event.textContent = `open, ${instance.item.querySelector('button').textContent.trim()}`), // demo
            close: (instance) => (_event.textContent = `close, ${instance.item.querySelector('button').textContent.trim()}`), // demo
        },
    });
});
{% endraw %}{% endset %}

{{ scriptUsage({
    markup: markup,
    code: pageScript,
    note: '<code class="font-mono text-sm">new _accordion({ target, closeOthers, openFirst, duration, events })</code>. Methods: <code class="font-mono text-sm">open(set, animate)</code>, <code class="font-mono text-sm">close(set, animate)</code> (animate defaults to true), <code class="font-mono text-sm">toggle(set)</code>, <code class="font-mono text-sm">isOpen(set)</code>, <code class="font-mono text-sm">destroy()</code>. Events: <code class="font-mono text-sm">open</code>, <code class="font-mono text-sm">close</code>. Style the open state with <code class="font-mono text-sm">.active</code> on the set or <code class="font-mono text-sm">aria-expanded</code> on the title. Reduced motion skips the animation. The chat bubbles are only css on top, <code class="font-mono text-sm">chat-accordion.css</code> keys off <code class="font-mono text-sm">.active</code>.'
}) }}

{% footerscript %}
<script type="module">{{ pageScript | safe }}</script>
{% endfooterscript %}
